  "verseCount": 30,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "22",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 22"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "22",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo kūlwa kūgunanha banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbona ng'ombe nūūlū ng'holo ya ndūgūyo īlītagaalīja kūja sagala, yaya ū kwīlekanīja, īnyamage wīshoshe ū kūlī ng'weneyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'weneyo ūlū azengile kūle, nūūlū hamo ūtaamanile gete, īswagage wītwale kū ng'wako ūkīlang'hane kūshisha wize akwīkoobaga, ūng'winhe ī sabo yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ītaga gīko nūūlū ūbona nzobe ya ng'wa munhū yajimīīlaga, nūūlū shizwalo shakwe, nūūlū shikolo shingī shose shose īsho ūjimīīja; yaya ū kūshilekanīja sagala dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūmona ndūgūyo alī na nzobe nūūlū ng'ombe yagwaga hihī na nzīla, yaya ū kūnekanīja, ngunanhage ū kwīgūngūmūla. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma atigeleelilwe kūzwala shizwalo sha bagoosha, nū ngosha yaya ū kūzwala shizwalo sha bakīma, nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo wīta mihayo īlī gīko, alī wa malofu ū kūlī SEEBA Mulungu wako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūbona chanjo sha noni bbihī na nzīla, hamo īteelelile mu ntī nūūlū hasī, nī noni yenekīlī ībandīlile a ha ng'hune nūūlū a magī, yaya ū kwīsola ī noni yenīyo hamò nī ng'hune. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūsola ī ng'hune, nekage ū nina aje; ū mhayo gwenūyū gūkūkwenhela mbango, nīyo ūkūbiza na būlamu būlīhu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ūzenga numba mhya īlī na ha kwifuulīla ū kwigūlya, ītūūlīlage na ikīgījo ū kū mhelo mhelo, ūtiziyenheleja makoye ga kūchīlwa munhū, ūlū ūgwa kūfuma ū kwigūlya ya numba yako. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu ngūnda gwako gwa mizabibu yaya ū kūhamba mbīyū ja mbika ibīlī, ūlū wīta gīko a matina ayo ūlagahambe ū mu ngūnda na a matwajo gakūbiza gatī meela.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22:9",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Gatī meela:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Hū kūhaya gatigeleelilwe kū nīmo gwa ng'wipandī lyeela.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūtizūtunganīja ng'ombe na nzobe hijoki līmò, gīkī jidute igembe lya kūlīma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nū bebe yaya kūzwala shizwalo shisumilwe na būlūba wa kitani īsangīlījiwe na booya wa ng'holo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū kū mhembeelo ya shizwalo shako ī sha kūzwala ūkūyūsumīīla masune.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Shilagīlo sha kūlang'hana batooleke",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū munhū ūntoola ng'wanikī, hūna wa kūhayūlaala nang'hwe ūmbyeeda, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wandya kūja akūnsondagūlaga alīng'haya kībi, “Ū nkīma ūyū nantoolile a hene, alīyo aho naalaala nang'hwe, nūbona gīkī wamala kūlaala na bagosha bangī!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na lūūlū a henaho a ba ise nū nina wa ng'wanikī bakūja kū mita gwa nzengo bakafunye būkaanīji ū kū banamhala ba mu nzengo, booleche gīkī ū nshīke wabo walī ataalī kūlaala na ngosha ūngī ose ose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ise wa ng'wanikī akūbawīla a banamhala, “Ū nene nakanzunīlīja ū ngosha ng'wenūyū antoole ū nshīke wane, alīyo ī haha wambyeedile. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wandije kūja akūnsondagūlaga, akūhayaga, ‘Ū nshīke wako naamonile gīkī gashi walī wamala kūlaala na bagosha bangī.’ Alīyo shiishi ī shimanīkījo sha koolecha gīkī ū nshīke wane walī ataalī kūlaala na bagosha.” A babyaji ba ng'wanikī bakoolecha ī shizwalo sha nshīke wabo ū kū banamhala ba mu nzengo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī likanza lyenīlo a banamhala bakūng'wīnja ū ngosha ng'wenūyo a henaho, ūūkatūlwa mbooko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma akūlyiwa ihyū lya shekeli igana ja feza, ūng'winha ū ise wa ng'wanikī kūlwa nguno wakenaagūlile lina lya nshīke wa mu Isilaeli. Hama akūnsola aje nang'hwe akongeje kūbiza nke wakwe. Atigeleelilwe kūmpeeja nūūlū kūneka ū mu būpanga wakwe bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ū mhayo gwenūyo ūlū gūbiza gwa ng'hana, nū būkaanīji būgaya ū wa koolecha gīkī walī ataalī kūlaala na ngosha aho ataalī kūtoolwa nū munhū ng'wenūyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a henaho akūshoshiwa kaya, wiza ūtūūlwa ha nyango gwa ha ng'wawe, hūna a bagoosha ba mu nzengo būmponda mawe kūshisha ūcha; nguno wītile mhayo gwa minala mu Isilaeli, īkī wītile būmalahya alī mu kaya ya ng'wa ise. Shiigelile ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ngosha ūsanganījiwa alīshihya na nke wa ngosha ūngī, a bose būbīlī wabo bakūcha; ū ngosha ū nshihya nū nkīma ūyo walūshihyaga nang'hwe. Shiigelile ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūlū ng'wanikī alūnjiwe hūna ūmanhya na ngosha ūngī mu nzengo ūlaala nang'hwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bose būbīlī wabo mukūbatwala kū mita gwa nzengo gwenūyo mukabaponde mawe mubabūlage. Ū ng'wanikī akūcha kūlwa nguno walī mu nzengo, alīyo atalīlile gīkī bize banhū kūngunanha, ū ngosha kūlwa nguno washihyaga na nke wa munhū ūngī. Shiigeli ūwīnje gete ū būbi ū mu bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū ngosha alī kū malaale ūnsanga ng'wanikī alūnjiwe, hūna ūmpondya ūlaala nang'hwe, ū ngosha ūyo wagwītaga ū mhayo gwenūyo akūbūlagwa wei dūhū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yaya ū kūng'wītīla mhayo gose gose ū ng'wanikī, nguno atītile mhayo gwigeleelilwe kūbūlagwa; ū mhayo gwenūyūū gūtikīlile nū gwa munhū wa kūng'ūbūkīla nzenganwa ng'wiye ūmūlaga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno ū ngosha ng'wenūyo wansangīlaga kū malaale ū ng'wanikī ūyo alūnjiwe, walī atīho munhū wa kūngunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.22.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.22.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 22:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hama ūlū ngosha ūmanhya na ng'wanikī atalūnjiwe, ūmpondya ūlaala nang'hwe, hūna būding'wa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
